# Fiotech Orbis - Design System & Color Palette

## 🎨 Brand Colors

### Primary Color Palette

```css
/* Fiotech Brand Colors */
--fiotech-navy-dark: #0a1628    /* Main background */
--fiotech-navy-light: #0d1d35   /* Cards, sidebar, popover */
--fiotech-gold: #f4c430         /* Primary accent, buttons */
--fiotech-gold-dark: #d4a520    /* Hover states */
```

### Design Patterns

```css
/* Border & Effects */
--border-subtle: white/10%       /* Subtle borders */
--border-hover: primary/50%      /* Gold hover borders */
--shadow-glow: shadow-primary/20 /* Gold glow effects */
--background-tint: primary/10    /* Gold background tints */
```

## 🌙 Dark Mode CSS Variables

```css
.dark {
  --background: oklch(0.11 0.02 240); /* Navy dark */
  --foreground: oklch(0.985 0 0); /* White text */
  --card: oklch(0.15 0.02 240); /* Navy light */
  --primary: oklch(0.82 0.15 85); /* Gold */
  --border: oklch(1 0 0 / 10%); /* Subtle white */
  --ring: oklch(0.82 0.15 85); /* Gold ring */
}
```

## 🎯 Component Standards

### Button Styling

- **Primary buttons**: Gold background (`#f4c430`) with navy text (`#0a1628`)
- **Outline buttons**: Gold border with hover effects
- **Ghost buttons**: Hover with gold tint (`primary/10`)
- **Always include**: Gold shadow effects (`shadow-primary/20`)

### Card Components

- **Background**: Navy light (`#0d1d35`)
- **Border**: Subtle white (`white/10%`)
- **Hover effects**: Gold border (`primary/50%`) + gold shadow
- **Transitions**: `duration-300` for smooth animations

### Form Elements (Input, Select)

- **Focus ring**: Gold (`primary/20-30`)
- **Focus border**: Gold (`border-primary`)
- **Hover effects**: Subtle gold border (`primary/30%`)
- **Background**: Navy with transparency (`input/30`)

### Badge Components

- **Default**: Gold background (`primary/10`) with gold text
- **Outline**: Gold border with hover effects
- **Consistent**: Gold accents for all variants in dark mode

## 📦 Usage Guidelines

### Color Usage Rules

- Background: Navy dark (`#0a1628`) or navy light (`#0d1d35`)
- Primary actions: Gold (`#f4c430`)
- Text: White or muted gray
- Borders: Subtle white (`white/10%`)

### Hover Effects

- Cards: `hover:border-primary/50 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/10`
- Buttons: `hover:shadow-primary/30`
- Interactive elements: Gold tint on hover

### Focus States

- Form elements: Gold ring (`ring-primary/20`)
- Buttons: Gold border (`border-primary`)
- Consistent focus indicators

### Transitions

- Use `transition-all duration-300` for smooth animations
- Hover effects should be smooth and professional

## 🎨 Brand Identity

### Logo Usage

- **Primary logo**: "FIOTECH ORBIS" with gold accent
- **Icon**: Upward trending chart in gold
- **Placement**: Sidebar header only (not in main content header)
- **Sizing**: Consistent with design system

### Typography

- **Headings**: Bold, professional
- **Body text**: Clean, readable
- **Accent text**: Gold color for highlights
- **Muted text**: Gray-400 for secondary information

## 🚫 Anti-Patterns

### Avoid These Patterns

- ❌ Generic gray/blue color schemes
- ❌ Purple or blue primary colors
- ❌ Harsh borders or shadows
- ❌ Inconsistent hover effects
- ❌ Light mode as default
- ❌ Duplicate logos in header
- ❌ Generic shadcn styling without Fiotech branding

### Instead Use

- ✅ Navy + Gold color scheme
- ✅ Subtle, elegant effects
- ✅ Consistent gold accents
- ✅ Professional appearance
- ✅ Dark mode optimized
- ✅ Single logo placement
- ✅ Fiotech-branded components

## 📱 Responsive Design

### Breakpoints

- Mobile: < 768px
- Tablet: 768px - 1280px
- Desktop: 1280px+
- Large: 1920px+

### Component Behavior

- All components must work across all breakpoints
- Maintain Fiotech styling on all screen sizes
- Responsive spacing and sizing
- Touch-friendly on mobile

## 🔧 Technical Standards

### CSS Classes

```css
/* Standard hover effects */
.hover-gold-border {
  @apply hover:border-primary/50;
}
.hover-gold-glow {
  @apply hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/10;
}
.hover-gold-tint {
  @apply hover:bg-primary/10;
}

/* Focus states */
.focus-gold-ring {
  @apply focus-visible:ring-primary/20;
}
.focus-gold-border {
  @apply focus-visible:border-primary;
}

/* Transitions */
.smooth-transition {
  @apply transition-all duration-300;
}
```

### Component Structure

- Use shadcn/ui as base
- Override with Fiotech styling
- Maintain accessibility (ARIA)
- TypeScript types required
- No linting errors

